# rust/

Cargo workspace root containing seven member crates that together form the Udex universal lookup directory system. Manages shared dependencies, workspace configuration, development guidelines, and build artifacts for the complete system spanning API definitions, CLI, server, SDK, datastore, and test utilities.

## Dirs

- `api/` -- Protobuf-generated gRPC types, service definitions, and authorization logic
- `cli/` -- Command-line interface for Udex with argument parsing and configuration management
- `datastore/` -- PostgreSQL persistence layer with migrations, traits, and integration test fixtures
- `sdk/` -- Rust client SDK for Udex with async APIs, TLS, and OAuth2 token management
- `server/` -- gRPC server implementation with service handlers, middleware, and JWT validation
- `target/` -- Rust compiler and build system artifacts directory
- `test-utils/` -- Dev-only library providing shared test fixtures and OAuth2 utilities

## Files

- `Cargo.toml` -- Workspace manifest with member definitions, shared dependency versions, and workspace package metadata
- `Cargo.lock` -- Locked dependency versions for reproducible builds
- `CONTRIBUTING.md` -- Rust-specific development guidelines, code style rules, and pre-commit checklist
- `.gitignore` -- Version control exclusions for Rust build artifacts, IDE files, and development artifacts
